From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kushal khemka <kushalkhemka@Kushals-MacBook-Air.local>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:04:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] mimalloc: the scavenger's safety-net wait doubles while
 nothing interrupts it

With nothing scheduled the scavenger woke every 30 s for good to look over the arenas, the last periodic
wake-up of an idle process (Pi at its prompt: 0.1-0.6 ms each). The wait now doubles after each one that
nothing interrupted, up to an hour, and is back to 30 s as soon as anything wakes the scavenger or a purge is
scheduled.
---
 patches/mimalloc/scavenger-idle-backoff.patch | 44 +++++++++++++++++++
 scripts/build/deps/mimalloc.ts                |  5 ++-
 2 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 patches/mimalloc/scavenger-idle-backoff.patch

