What BytecodeLinkEncoder::Result::namesOfFunctionsRun names is appended to
BUN_STATIC_HEAP_FUNCTIONS_FIRST's list as its second tier (a name the list has keeps its
own tier). The list's names are positions in the program's text and go stale with every
edit of it; these come from the order file's F lines, which do not. See the WebKit
commit of the same name for the measurements.
